        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;div style=&quot;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#38BDF8;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;&quot;&gt;CHÚ THÍCH KÝ HIỆU &amp;amp; QUY ƯỚC THIẾT KẾ OOP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border:0;border-top:1px solid #475569;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;  &lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ký hiệu khóa:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color:#FDE047;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[PK]&lt;/span&gt; = Khóa chính (Id Guid) &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;color:#38BDF8;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[FK]&lt;/span&gt; = Khóa ngoại trỏ đến Entity cha&lt;/td&gt;  &lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phạm vi:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;+&lt;/b&gt; : public &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;-&lt;/b&gt; : private &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;color:#93C5FD;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;$&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; : Static Factory Method&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;  &lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Quan hệ:&lt;/b&gt; ───◇ Kết tập (Club chứa Members) &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; ───▷ Kế thừa &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; ───&amp;gt; Kết hợp (Association) kèm bản số (Multiplicity)&lt;/td&gt;  &lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Vòng đời Registration:&lt;/b&gt; Pending ➔ (Confirm) ➔ Confirmed ➔ (CheckIn.Create) ➔ Đã điểm danh &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; (Cancel) ➔ Cancelled&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fillColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
